  "scenario_text": "# Experiment B - network delay propagation (RQ1 / H1).\n# Independent variables: injected gateway->pricing link delay d in {0, 25, 50, 100} ms and call mode\n# (sequential vs parallel). Controlled: gateway->inventory link fixed at 50 ms, so in parallel mode\n# pricing runs alongside a dependency whose delay is >= d for d <= 50 (H1's condition).\n# Other links are 0 (inventory-b and the simulated-to-simulated links are not on the request path).\n# Link delays are configured values, not measured provider latencies.\nid: B_network_delay\ntitle: \"B - Network delay on the pricing link, sequential vs parallel\"\nhypotheses: [H1]\nrequires_mode: simulated\nworkload: {rate_rps: 20, arrival: poisson, warmup_s: 5, duration_s: 30}\nruns: 3\nseed: 202\ndefaults:\n  links:\n    local--aws-simulated: 50\n    local--gcp-simulated: 50\n    local--azure-simulated: 0\n    aws-simulated--azure-simulated: 0\n    aws-simulated--gcp-simulated: 0\n    azure-simulated--gcp-simulated: 0\nconditions:\n  - {name: seq-d0, call_mode: sequential}\n  - {name: seq-d25, call_mode: sequential, links: {local--azure-simulated: 25}}\n  - {name: seq-d50, call_mode: sequential, links: {local--azure-simulated: 50}}\n  - {name: seq-d100, call_mode: sequential, links: {local--azure-simulated: 100}}\n  - {name: par-d0, call_mode: parallel}\n  - {name: par-d25, call_mode: parallel, links: {local--azure-simulated: 25}}\n  - {name: par-d50, call_mode: parallel, links: {local--azure-simulated: 50}}\n  - {name: par-d100, call_mode: parallel, links: {local--azure-simulated: 100}}\n",
